# Regenerable outputs of a reproduction — never commit these (not even to LFS).
# They can always be produced again by re-running the case.
**/build/
**/outputs/
**/.cache/

# LaTeX build artifacts
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.bbl
*.blg

# The exported argument graph IS the deliverable — keep it even though the
# repo root ignores *.db. Prefer committing graph.json when the exporter allows.
!**/graph.db
!**/graph.json
